### 6. DATA PROTECTION & PRIVACY

```yaml
data_protection:
  classification:
    Level 4: Proprietary AI Models:
      controls: [Encryption, Access Control, Audit Logging, No Export, No Sharing]
      examples: [Model weights, training data, proprietary algorithms]
    
    Level 3: Verification Results:
      controls: [Encryption, Access Control, Audit Logging, Limited Retention]
      examples: [Product verdicts, compliance status, certificate data]
    
    Level 2: Business Data:
      controls: [Encryption, Access Control, Audit Logging]
      examples: [Vendor information, product details, commercial data]
    
    Level 1: Public Data:
      controls: [Optional Encryption, Access Control]
      examples: [Halal standards, public regulations, published E-codes]
  
  processing_requirements:
    data_minimization: Only process data necessary for verification
    purpose_limitation: Only for authorized halal verification purposes
    storage_limitation: Keep only as long as legally and commercially required
    integrity_maintenance: Maintain data accuracy and integrity
    accuracy_validation: Regular validation of verification results
  
  data_subject_rights:
    - Right to access their data
    - Right to rectification
    - Right to erasure (subject to legal requirements)
    - Right to data portability
    - Right to object to processing
  
  compliance_frameworks:
    - GDPR (General Data Protection Regulation) — European Union
    - CCPA (California Consumer Privacy Act) — USA
    - PDPA (Personal Data Protection Act 2010) — Malaysia
    - PDPA (Personal Data Protection Act 2021) — Singapore
    - ISO 27001:2022 Information Security Management
    - ISO 27701:2019 Privacy Information Management
    - SOC 2 Type II attestation
    - NIST Cybersecurity Framework
    - MyDIGITAL Malaysia Cybersecurity Framework
  
  breach_notification:
    timeline: Within 24 hours of discovery
    authority_notification: As required by applicable law
    affected_parties: As required by applicable law
```

